rdtools: Efficient Manipulation of 'Rd' Files and Help Topics

Provides fast, cached lookup of help topics and aliases across installed,
source, and in-development packages, plus efficient retrieval of parsed
'Rd' ('R' documentation) objects. Per-package indexes are built once and
cached, making repeated retrieval cheap enough to call in a tight loop.


